      <p>No. 139, 2015</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Australian Immunisation Register</i> <i>Act 2015</i> and to deal with consequential and transitional matters arising from the enactment and amendment of that Act, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 12 November 2015</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
